<h2 id="become-a-contributor" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#become-a-contributor">#</a> Become a Contributor</h2>
<p>Want to join the team? We welcome contributions of all kinds:</p>
<h3 id="ways-to-contribute" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#ways-to-contribute">#</a> Ways to Contribute</h3>
<p><strong>Code</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Fix bugs and implement features</li>
<li>Build plugins and themes</li>
<li>Improve performance</li>
<li>Add tests</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Write guides and tutorials</li>
<li>Improve existing docs</li>
<li>Translate documentation</li>
<li>Create examples</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Design</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Design new themes</li>
<li>Improve UI/UX</li>
<li>Create illustrations</li>
<li>Build design systems</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Community</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Help others on Discord</li>
<li>Answer questions on GitHub</li>
<li>Write blog posts</li>
<li>Share your projects</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Outreach</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Give talks and presentations</li>
<li>Write about MarkoPress</li>
<li>Share on social media</li>
<li>Organize meetups</li>
</ul>
